# Valid Emails

## Problem Summary
Write a query to find users whose email addresses follow the required format and end with the case-sensitive domain `@leetcode.com`.

## Solution
```sql
SELECT user_id, name, mail FROM Users
WHERE mail REGEXP '^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_.-]*@leetcode\\.com$'
AND mail LIKE BINARY '%@leetcode.com';
```
